      "description": {
        "es": "Si le alcanza un movimiento de tipo Fuego o Agua, le sube muchísimo la Velocidad.",
        "en": "Raises the user's Speed by three stages when it is hit by a Fire- or Water-type attack. The attack still deals damage."
